1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,813
Claude Code 有六种权限模式，
Claude Code has six permission modes,

2
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:03,880
从事事问你，到完全放手。
from asking about everything to letting go entirely.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,341
手动：只读不用问，
Manual reads freely and asks about everything else.

4
00:00:05,361 --> 00:00:07,126
其余先问你。接受编辑：
Accept edits also skips the prompt

5
00:00:07,146 --> 00:00:09,740
改文件和常见文件命令，也不问。
for file edits and common file commands.

6
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,584
计划：只研究、只提方案，
Plan researches and proposes,

7
00:00:11,604 --> 00:00:13,060
不改你的源码。
without editing your source.

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,695
自动：多数直接放行，
Auto lets most things through,

9
00:00:14,715 --> 00:00:16,004
命令、联网这类，
and a separate classifier model reviews commands,

10
00:00:16,024 --> 00:00:18,530
交给另一个分类器模型先审。
network calls and the like first.

11
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,957
不再询问：只放行预先批准的，
Don't ask allows only pre-approved tools and denies the rest,

12
00:00:20,977 --> 00:00:23,870
其余直接拒绝，适合 CI 无人值守。
which suits CI where no one is there to confirm.

13
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,808
绕过权限：跳过所有检查，
Bypass permissions skips every check,

14
00:00:25,828 --> 00:00:28,630
只能放在隔离的容器或虚拟机里。
and belongs only inside an isolated container or VM.

15
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,352
日常按 Shift+Tab，在前四种间轮着
Day to day, Shift+Tab cycles the first four modes,

16
00:00:31,372 --> 00:00:34,140
切，状态栏随时显示当前模式。
and the status bar always shows where you are.

17
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,351
自动模式拦强制推送、生产部署、
Auto mode blocks force pushes, production deploys,

18
00:00:36,371 --> 00:00:38,580
把下载的代码直接丢进 shell。
and piping downloaded code straight into a shell.

19
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,404
想看最新的拦截名单，命令行
To see the current block list,

20
00:00:40,424 --> 00:00:42,650
跑 claude auto-mode defaults。
run claude auto-mode defaults from the command line.

21
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:43,691
连续被拦三次，
After three blocks in a row,

22
00:00:43,711 --> 00:00:46,250
自动模式就会暂停，回到弹窗询问。
auto mode pauses and goes back to asking you.

23
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:48,136
新版本里，终端新会话默认
In newer versions, new terminal sessions start

24
00:00:48,156 --> 00:00:50,580
就是自动模式，先看状态栏。
in auto mode by default, so check the status bar first.

25
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,700
分类器管意图，不管对错：
The classifier checks intent, not correctness:

26
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,000
认证写坏了，它照样放行。
break authentication and it still waves it through.

27
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,472
所以要搭一个跑测试的 Stop 钩子：
So pair it with a Stop hook that runs your tests:

28
00:00:57,492 --> 00:00:59,850
一个管动手前，一个管收工后。
one guards intent before, the other correctness after.

29
00:00:59,870 --> 00:01:02,470
放手可以，但要有人验收。
Letting go is fine, but keep something checking the result.
